  <item>
    <title>那些让人心惊肉跳的小事（07诡邻人）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afbc212a4a79edf137a7318</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afbc212a4a79edf137a7318</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:01:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>月租八百，两室一厅，还带一个储物间。邻居告诉她，这房子死过人。</span></p><p><span>她在做直播，数据一直不好。听到「凶宅」两个字，她第一反应是：这是老天爷空投的流量。</span></p><p><span>储物间的门房东锁着，说里面放的是杂物。后来他们撬开了。屋里有一个井盖，铸铁的，嵌在水泥地上。</span></p><p><span>当天晚上的直播，是她的账号第一次上四位数。再往后的事，她自己也没想明白。</span></p><p><span>本篇是都市怪谈短篇系列《那些让人心惊肉跳的小事》的第七件，恐怖、惊悚、悬疑，全长 79 分钟。</span></p><p><strong><span>第一次听这个系列？直接跳到</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a>，</span><strong><span>前面不用听。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:00:05</a> 开场 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">00:01:29</a> 前情提要 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">00:04:04</a> 镜子里有东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 鬼邻人 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">00:06:32</a> 李老师和隆哥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">00:09:03</a> 隆哥之死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">00:09:40</a> 玄学主播</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">00:11:26</a> 徐小姐的私信</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a> 宣布恋情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">00:21:22</a> 冰箱里的剩菜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">00:26:57</a> 流量大礼包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">00:34:55</a> 井盖 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2185">00:36:25</a> 封禁 24 小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">00:48:38</a> 他来过这里 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">00:58:49</a> 有话要说 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4217">01:10:17</a> 床底</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">01:14:00</a> 批捕 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4571">01:16:11</a> 那个井盖的来历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4674">01:17:54</a> 黑雾 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">01:18:30</a> 影子</span></p><p><span>附注：</span></p><p><span>1、本节目所有人物、事件、机构均为虚构。如有雷同，纯属巧合。</span></p><p><span>2、本故事虽然是系列故事，这是第七集，没听过前面的也能听。</span></p><p><span>3、主页可查看全集，选择收听。</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
