  <item>
    <title>那些让人心惊肉跳的小事（05善后）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae94ebc97726cd4675be287</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae94ebc97726cd4675be287</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:09:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>车撞了人。老板下车看了一眼，回来说：这条路没有监控。</span></p><p><span>她把尸体抬进后备箱，把电瓶车推进水塘，最后把人也推进一口积满雨水的地下天井。</span></p><p><span>第三天，她当着老板的面，用鞋接了自己的尿喝下去。老板喝不下去，转身，却把尸体重新捞了出来。</span></p><p><span>本篇是都市怪谈短篇系列《那些让人心惊肉跳的小事》的第五件，恐怖、惊悚，没听过前面的也能听，全长 58 分钟。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:00:59</a> 前情提要 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a> 善后 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">00:02:52</a> 三个通宵之后 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a> 裸辞第三个月 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">00:09:31</a> 天上掉下来的东西 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">00:12:09</a> 没有监控 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">00:13:42</a> 烂尾楼 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> 门关上了 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">00:24:44</a> 简历是假的 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">00:28:47</a> 那张 SIM 卡 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">00:37:45</a> 他趴了下去 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">00:41:13</a> 黑暗里 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> 门被拉开 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">00:52:29</a> 警察说的 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">00:56:26</a> 一堆问号 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">00:57:49</a> 阿峰</span></p><p></p><p><span>附注：</span></p><p><span>1、本节目所有人物、事件、机构均为虚构。如有雷同，纯属巧合。</span></p><p><span>2、本故事虽然是系列故事，这是第五集，但是没听过前面的也能听。</span></p><p><span>3、主页可查看全集，选择收听。</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
