  <item>
    <title>那些让人心惊肉跳的小事（03青少年愚公）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad6e1dfa8621318345a852f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad6e1dfa8621318345a852f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:41:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>他和一个女孩睡过同一张床，什么都没发生。他们是兄弟。</span></p><p><span>毕业前，她攒起了酒局。一人一百，女生免单。他求了三次才被允许参加。</span></p><p><span>前三场都是灾难，第四场，他见到了一个天仙。</span></p><p><span>本篇是都市怪谈短篇系列《那些让人心惊肉跳的小事》的第三件，没听过前面也能听，全长 41 分钟。</span></p><p><strong><span>PS：对同福天使这个组织有兴趣的可以去听《那些让人毛骨悚然的小事》；对阿哲的下落有兴趣的可以去听《遗祟》</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 开场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a> 前情提要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">00:03:10</a> 腊肠：隐私算个屁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">00:04:13</a> 青少年愚公</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">00:04:21</a> 老屌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a> 攒局：女生免单 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">00:12:18</a> 三场灾难 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">00:17:43</a> 专属局：居酒屋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">00:20:41</a> 进房间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">00:24:10</a> 她的妆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">00:28:28</a> 卸妆之后</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">00:32:10</a> 五千块</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">00:35:57</a> 敲诈勒索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">00:39:28</a> 你上次讲的不是这样</span></p><p><span>附注：</span></p><p><span>1、本节目所有人物、事件、机构均为虚构。如有雷同，纯属巧合。</span></p><p><span>2、本故事虽然是系列故事，这是第三集，但是没听过前面的也能听。</span></p><p><span>3、主页可查看全集，选择收听。</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
